      "tipsZh": [
        "RV park 是房车营地，full hookup 指水、电、下水都能接。",
        "一晚按位置 site 收费，通常含淋浴和洗衣房。",
        "旺季位子紧张，最好提前打电话订。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "send-letter-west",
      "titleEn": "Sending a Letter",
      "titleZh": "在邮局寄信",
      "descZh": "寄一封平信回国：问邮资、贴邮票的位置。",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "en": "I want to send a letter to China.",
          "zh": "我想寄一封信到中国。",
          "keyExpressions": [
            { "en": "send a letter", "zh": "寄信" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "B",
          "en": "Regular mail or express?",
          "zh": "平信还是快递？",
          "keyExpressions": [
            { "en": "regular mail / express", "zh": "平信 / 快递" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "en": "Regular mail is fine.",
          "zh": "平信就行。",
          "keyExpressions": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "B",
          "en": "Okay. That's two dollars.",
          "zh": "好的。两美元。",
          "keyExpressions": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "en": "Where do I put the stamp?",
          "zh": "邮票贴在哪里？",
          "keyExpressions": [
            { "en": "stamp", "zh": "邮票" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "B",
          "en": "In the top right corner.",
          "zh": "贴在右上角。",
          "keyExpressions": [
            { "en": "top right corner", "zh": "右上角" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "en": "Thank you. All set.",
          "zh": "谢谢，都好了。",
          "keyExpressions": []
        }
      ],
      "tipsZh": [
        "寄信说 send a letter，平信 regular mail、快递 express。",
        "邮票 stamp 贴在信封右上角，写完地址就能投邮筒。",
        "邮筒是蓝色的，路边和邮局门口都有。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "community-pool-west",
      "titleEn": "At the Community Pool",
      "titleZh": "社区游泳池",
      "descZh": "到社区泳池问通行证、浅水区和下水的规矩。",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "en": "Do I need a pass to swim here?",
          "zh": "在这里游泳要通行证吗？",
          "keyExpressions": [
            { "en": "pass", "zh": "通行证" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "B",
          "en": "Yes, it's five dollars for adults.",
          "zh": "要，大人五美元。",
          "keyExpressions": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "en": "Is there a shallow area?",
          "zh": "有浅水区吗？",
          "keyExpressions": [
            { "en": "shallow area", "zh": "浅水区" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "B",
          "en": "Yes, on the left side.",
          "zh": "有，在左边。",
          "keyExpressions": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "en": "Do I need a swimming cap?",
          "zh": "需要戴泳帽吗？",
          "keyExpressions": [
            { "en": "swimming cap", "zh": "泳帽" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "B",
          "en": "No, but you need a shower first.",
          "zh": "不用，但要先冲个淋浴。",
          "keyExpressions": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "en": "Okay. Thanks.",
          "zh": "好的，谢谢。",
          "keyExpressions": []
        }
      ],
      "tipsZh": [
        "社区泳池要买 pass（通行证），大人小孩价格不同。",
        "下水前先淋浴是常见规矩，浅水区 shallow area 适合新手。",
        "泳道叫 lane，问一句 Which lane is open? 就能找到位置。"
      ]
    },
    {
